## Legal Citations
- **CNIL Karar SAN-2023-003 Cityscoot (16.03.2023) (ePrivacy Md. 5(3) / Fransız Veri Koruma Kanunu Md. 82)**: reCAPTCHA terminal cihazdan bilgi okur/yazar ve telemetri Google'a akar; "kesinlikle gerekli" muafiyeti kapsamında sayılmadığı için ön rıza gerekir. Aynı kararda aşırı konum takibi (Md. 5/1-c) ve alt işleyen sözleşmeleri (Md. 28) de ihlal sayılmıştır.
- **CJEU C-252/21 Meta v. Bundeskartellamt (04.07.2023) (GDPR Md. 6(1))**: Üçüncü taraf izleme, sözleşme (6/1-b) veya meşru menfaat (6/1-f) ile haklı gösterilemez; rıza gerekir.

## Rule Mandates
- MUST: Prefer zero-telemetry, privacy-preserving CAPTCHA solutions based on local client-side Proof-of-Work (Altcha, mCaptcha, Cloudflare Turnstile).
- MUST: If Google reCAPTCHA v2/v3 or hCaptcha is utilized, strictly gate script loading behind prior explicit cookie consent under the "Security/Functional" category.
- MUST: Never execute reCAPTCHA scripts on initial unconsented page loads (CNIL Decision SAN-2023-003).
- MUST: Provide fallback verification mechanisms (email/SMS OTP) for users who reject tracking CAPTCHAs.

## Forbidden Anti-Patterns
- NEVER: <script src="https://www.google.com/recaptcha/api.js"></script> loaded directly without prior consent gating
- NEVER: <div className="g-recaptcha"> rendered on login/signup forms without checking user cookie consent
- NEVER: Claiming that behavioral reCAPTCHA fingerprinting qualifies as a strictly necessary cookie exempt from consent

## Reference Compliant Code Snippets
### Rıza Kontrollü Captcha Yükleme
```tsx
import { CookieConsentManager } from '@complirules/primitives';

export function Captcha({ prefs }: { prefs: Parameters<typeof CookieConsentManager.isCategoryAllowed>[0] }) {
  // Rıza yoksa telemetri göndermeyen, yerel Proof-of-Work doğrulamasına düşülür
  if (!CookieConsentManager.isCategoryAllowed(prefs, 'functional')) {
    return <ProofOfWorkChallenge endpoint="/api/pow-challenge" />;
  }
  return <ThirdPartyCaptcha />;
}
